# Project Rules & Architecture

## Architecture
- `client/`: AI Mock Interview (React + TS + Vite + Tailwind + shadcn). Keep existing UI/styles intact.
- `server/`: MERN Backend (Express + Mongoose + JWT).
- Do not use old MERN client; only use the backend.
- Security: Gemini API key strictly on server only. Never expose AI keys on client.

## Development Rules
1. Do only the current stage.
2. Read only files needed.
3. No refactors outside scope.
4. Keep existing UI/styles.
5. Validate inputs.
6. Response format: Reply with changed files list, max 5 lines, no explanations.
